looking for your next RPG fix well look  no further because we've got this year's  smartest and most compelling RPG  experience right here Soul hackers too  this original Standalone tale will take  you on a heady journey through a gritty  futuristic World in which people and  demons coexist and the end of the world  is fast approaching  there's so much to love about the latest  title from Atlas the company who brought  you the Beloved Persona and shin Megami  tensei series but since we don't want to  keep you here all day let's just run  through the top three  Soul hackers 2 isn't your typical jrpg  it's not your average silly adventure  with teenagers this story focuses on  Ringo and AI given human form who's been  tasked with saving the world from its  imminent doom and to do that she'll need  to make use of the power of Soul hacking  to bring key allies back from death and  explore Japan's strange underbelly where  demons and people live alongside each  other the deeper Ringo goes into this  world and connects with her new  teammates the more complicated and  interesting it gets this is a serious  thoughtful and Powerful story about the  nature of human existence and our future  it's the kind of game that'll give you a  ton to think about even when you're not  playing it it's all too rare that RPGs  give us a woman as a lead character  which is a shame because the ones that  do tend to be pretty great but  fortunately we've got one of those dope  female protagonists right here in Soul  hackers too in this game we're  experiencing Ringo's life from the very  moment she was created and her life's  journey is definitely one worth taking  Ringo isn't just a badass she's also  usually the smartest person in the room  quick to understand and process new  information and work out new solutions  to every problem that rears its ugly  head she may have just been born  yesterday but she's no dummy this lady  comes prepared when it's time to have  existential discussions about the nature  of the soul and what happens when we die  but even though she's a genius she's  still got a lot to learn about humans  and herself this is a complicated world  full of complicated characters and Ringo  has her work cut out for her if she  wants to get to the bottom of all of  this but with her brains and a Charming  team of devil Summoners they might just  have a chance battles and soul hackers  too are all about harnessing the power  of demons against your foes in this  world devil Summoners find and enter  into contracts with demons to utilize  their abilities Persona and smt fans  will find themselves right at home  because the demons here work a lot like  the personas from those games once  you've befriended a new demon you can  develop it by using it in battle to gain  experience and new abilities or fuse it  with another demon to create a whole new  stronger demon and there's so much more  you can do with them in Japan's secret  demon filled underbelly these guys are a  spectacle all to themselves it's Soul  hackers 2 wasn't on your radar already  it should be this is a smart and  thoughtful RPG for a wider audience with  an incredible new female protagonist in  an original story that doesn't require  any ketchup and you get to play with  demons sounds to me like Soul hackers 2  is a game you're gonna need to get into  why not
 

